window.products.push({"id":1085118,"name":"studio_312, 12 oz Handmade Ceramic Mug with a Bunny Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oQBTByQlL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"This handmade mug is made by Korean ceramic artist who is running studio_312. All pottery by studio_31 is made out of non-toxic materials(100% lead-free), and has artist’s serious touch. studio_312 pursuits simple, unique, and enjoyable design. In addition, studio_312 does focus on making the best quality ceramics. This mug comes with a characterized lid. This mug is good for daily use. The lid helps to keep your drink warm and protect against dust when you use. Each ceramic piece is not exactly same like factory products because of hand-crafted process from start to finish. This ceramic mug is made out of stoneware and fired at 2280℉ which means that it is vitrified and impervious to water. Small bubbles and flaws in the glazed surface, and color tone differences are not faults. These are happened naturally during handmade steps and kiln firing in Ceramics. Therefore, these things make your pottery one of a kind. Each piece is dishwasher and microwave safe. Mug: 5x3.5x3.7(h)in. Lid: 3.5x3.5x4(h)in.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oQBTByQlL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"studio_312","source_asin":"B07YBQTB9H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085118","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YBQTB9H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YBQTB9H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1085119,"name":"Seiko QXA342SRH Classic Wall Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Kp1Qdj7vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description Silver-tone metallic finish case Quiet Sweep second hand Glass crystal One \"AA\" battery included 17 3/4\" x 7 3/8\" x 1 5/8\" The Seiko Story From Humble beginnings, Kintaro Hattori’s Vision for Seiko has become reality. A consuming passion for excellence - imprinted in our Corporate DNA passed from generation to generation. Seiko, for 125 years committed to the art and science of time. A culture of innovation connects a 19th century Tokyo clock shop with 20th century advances in timekeeping to an extraordinary 21st century \"quiet revolution.\" Continually driven by dedication and passion, established a multitude of world’s first technologies… transforming the principles of timekeeping. The first quartz wristwatch – changed the history of time. The first Kinetic – marked a new era in quartz watch technology. In 1969, Seiko Astron, the first quartz wristwatch - was introduced. In an instant, Seiko exponentially improved the accuracy of wristwatches –And Seiko technology firmly established today’s standard in Olympic and sports timing. 1984, another celebrated first – Kinetic Technology – powered by body movement. Kinetic – a quartz mechanism with unparalleled accuracy –the driving force behind more world’s firsts. Kinetic Chronograph – the next generation of high performance timekeeping. Kinetic Auto Relay – automatically resets to the correct time. Kinetic Perpetual - combining the date perfect technology of perpetual calendar with the genius of Kinetic Auto Relay. And now Kinetic Direct Drive – move, and the watch is powered automatically. Or hand wind it and see the power you are generating in real time. In the realm of fine watches, time is measured by Seiko innovation – A heritage of dedication to the art and science of time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Kp1Qdj7vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEIKO","source_asin":"B000B6PM2Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085119","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000B6PM2Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000B6PM2Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
