window.products.push({"id":1085155,"name":"Miracle Prayer Mat Noah's Ark Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51x8l9BRIgL._AC_.jpg","description":"Christian Miracle Prayer Mat: Teaching Kids Religion, Prayer, God, the Bible The Miracle Prayer Mat is a rug to decorate any room. Each mat can serve as specialty decor or as a prayer mat for children as they grow and get comfortable with religion and the Bible. The visual design serves as a reminder of the Bible & highlights a popular story in the Bible. The fun mat design will bring style, charm and creativity to any room. A must-have mat for Christian families who want their children to appreciate the Bible and religion. The Miracle Prayer Mat is soft yet durable, can be washed and is easily transported from room to room or home-to-home. Give the gift of prayer. The Miracle Prayer Mat and Miracle Prayers book make a wonderful gift for family and friends! The purpose of Miracle Prayer Mat is to teach children how to become more comfortable, self-confident and spiritually aware when it comes to religion and being a Christian, Our goal is also to bring families together in prayer. Here's what valued customers have said about The Miracle Prayer Mat: \"Our children love the Miracle Prayer Mat & Miracle Prayers book. I love that we have a designated place that our family can pray together and talk about Biblical stories. We look forward to our prayers before bed; it's a part of our nightly routine!\"-Mary Ritkin \"The Miracle Prayer Mat is a creative & genius tool to use for prayer!\" - Pastor Kevin Long Benefits of the Miracle Prayer Mat: Helps children learn about prayer using mat & Miracle Prayers book together. (Sold On Amazon & Kindle) Makes prayer fun for children Ideal size for men, women and children each mat is 18x18 Inches A great option to incorporate in Christian school curriculum, vacation bible school or religious events such as baptisms Unites children & families. Builds a stronger relationship with God. Made in the USA. Get your very own Noah's Ark Miracle Prayer Mat today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51x8l9BRIgL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Miracle Prayer Mat","source_asin":"B00MNUI77S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MNUI77S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MNUI77S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
