window.products.push({"id":1085227,"name":"Efavormart 2 Pack | 24\" Tall Gold Mercury Reversible Latour Trumpet Glass Vases for Wedding Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lA0N8IvHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"InformationFashioned from high quality clear glass in sleek trumpet shape, this Pilsner Vase is an emblem of style and sparkle! This glam piece features a splayed fluted base that rises elegantly to an eye-catching globe, stretching further to a graceful flared trumpet mouth.This clear reversible latour vase will elevate your flower decorations to the new level of gorgeousness! Either gift these beauties to your loved ones as a token of your affection, or use these to make stunning wedding centerpieces, floral displays, candle display and more!Additional Information:Glass Thickness: 2-3mmHand Blown Quality GlassNote: There is a block half way into the vase. Objects can only be placed half way into the base.How to Care:Prior to first use, glass pieces should be hand washed individually in warm soapy water, rinsed thoroughly and dried with a lint free cloth.For optimal finish & clarity, clean with a 50/50 solution of vinegar and water, let stand for a few hours then rinse well and dry with a lint free cloth.Our glass is produced overseas in extremely large quantities for our wholesale customers, due to transit and mass storage, all vases should be cleaned before use to remove any accumulated dust/dirt.Glass pieces should not be cleaned in a dish washer. Do not use products in microwaves or conventional ovens.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lA0N8IvHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"efavormart.com","source_asin":"B08XVRZZMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XVRZZMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XVRZZMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1085228,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Rio 4-Piece Stoneware Place Setting, Service for 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41V4BA9C8GL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Rio introduces a whole new way to look at stripes. Relaxed blue stripes take turns shifting positions and changing from wide to lean while continually maintaining their order on this exuberant dinnerware. For added interest, the stripes are reinterpreted in differing locations on each piece for a never-dull, often unexpected look. Amazon.com Bands of blue, varying in width and shade, set against a light-sand background evoke a Brazilian beach and cloudless sky in this casual dinnerware pattern called Rio. Particularly striking is the salad/dessert plate, with its subtly shaded, solid-blue center calling to mind a summer twilight. This set consists of a complete place setting: an 11-1/4-inch dinner plate; an 8-1/2-inch salad/dessert plate; a 6-inch, 20-ounce soup/cereal bowl; and a 10-ounce mug. Made of heavy stoneware, Rio pieces are chip-resistant and safe in the oven, freezer, microwave, and dishwasher. This dinnerware carries a three-year warranty against defects, and you can replace each piece individually. Pfaltzgraff makes Rio available in dinnerware, glassware, and accessories. --Fred Brack Whats in the Box 1 place setting. Place setting consists of 11-1/4-inch dinner plate; 8-1/2-inch salad/dessert plate; 6-inch, 20-ounce soup/cereal bowl; 10-ounce mug. 4 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41V4BA9C8GL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B000050XJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000050XJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000050XJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
