window.products.push({"id":1085263,"name":"Luxury Faux Pampas Grass Decor, 4 Feet Tall, Bunny Tail Included, Golden Beige, Boho Decor, Grass Decor for Dried Pampas Grass Plants, Boho Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517L3-GFNAL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"𝐈𝐍𝐂𝐋𝐔𝐃𝐄𝐒 𝟏𝟓 𝐁𝐔𝐍𝐍𝐘 𝐓𝐀𝐈𝐋𝐒 (𝐖𝐇𝐈𝐓𝐄) - For you as an additional gesture of appreciation, we are including 15 cute white bunny tails. They look great by themselves, or in a bouquet! 𝐋𝐈𝐅𝐄𝐓𝐈𝐌𝐄 𝐕𝐀𝐋𝐔𝐄, 𝐊𝐄𝐄𝐏𝐒 𝐂𝐎𝐋𝐎𝐑 𝐖𝐈𝐓𝐇 𝐍𝐎 𝐒𝐇𝐄𝐃𝐃𝐈𝐍𝐆 - With artificial grass decoration there is no need for concern with regards to maintenance. Your artificial pampas grass will keep its color forever, and it never sheds. Your faux pampas durable, not to mention allergy-free, odor-free, and bug-free. 𝐋𝐔𝐒𝐇 𝐒𝐎𝐅𝐓 & 𝐆𝐎𝐋𝐃 𝐁𝐄𝐈𝐆𝐄 - Crafted with silk feathers, your faux pampas grass wields a full, luxurious texture that will compliment your existing home decor. Each of our 3 large pampas grass stems are 4ft (48inches) tall with 22 thicc fluffy branches per stem. The warm and creamy hue is soothing and creates a space that immediately captures your guests’ interest. 𝐅𝐎𝐑 𝐇𝐎𝐌𝐄, 𝐎𝐅𝐅𝐈𝐂𝐄, 𝐎𝐑 𝐖𝐄𝐃𝐃𝐈𝐍𝐆𝐒 - Your pampas grass has many uses for decorating any space you can think of! It’s a staple for bohemian and rustic home decor and is perfect for creating elegant wedding decorations or sprucing up your living room by bringing earthy tones into your home. You can also use it to decorate your party venue or display it at your next special event. 𝐓𝐇𝐄 𝐏𝐄𝐑𝐅𝐄𝐂𝐓 𝐁𝐎𝐇𝐎 𝐆𝐈𝐅𝐓 - As a floor decor, ceremony backdrop, boho wedding accent piece, or in a bouquet. Your pampas grass is versatile and the perfect gift for anyone. Show your loved ones how thoughtful you are and give the gift of boho as a Mother's Day gift, Valentine's Day gift, anniversary gift or Christmas holidays. 𝐍𝐎 𝐐𝐔𝐄𝐒𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍𝐒 𝐀𝐒𝐊𝐄𝐃 𝐖𝐀𝐑𝐑𝐀𝐍𝐓𝐘 - At Entrancing Elegance, we stand by our products and offer a no questions asked warranty. If you experience any issues with your products, you will receive a full refund. Simply contact Entrancing Elegance directly through the Amazon messaging system and we will be happy to assist you with any issues. 100% 𝗖𝗨𝗦𝗧𝗢𝗠𝗘𝗥 𝗦𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗦𝗙𝗔𝗖𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡 is what we strive for.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517L3-GFNAL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Entrancing Elegance","source_asin":"B08D8ZGBLP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D8ZGBLP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D8ZGBLP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
