window.products.push({"id":1085289,"name":"Unicorn You're Amazing Just The Way You are Poster - 91.5 x 61cms (36 x 24 Inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ymAADeP0L._AC_.jpg","description":"This bundle includes a high quality, officially licensed poster and 4 adhesive pads. The supplied adhesive pads have a special non-permanent adhesive that will fix your poster securely without marking your wall. You can reposition the poster by simply peeling it off the wall and reapplying. The pads are so thin (only 1mm) that you wont even know they are there! They are suitable for any clean, non-porous surfaces such as painted walls, vinyl coated wallpaper, glass, metal etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ymAADeP0L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iPosters","source_asin":"B074G23J63","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085289","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074G23J63","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074G23J63","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1085290,"name":"West Bend 78222 Quik-Serve Toaster, Stainless Steel (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y-+27g4JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description West Bend Toasters bring together style, design, and functionality. With the West Bend Quik Serve Toaster, the process is extra fast too. Perfectly browned toast slides through to the bottom tray in under 90 seconds. This Quik Serve Toaser is UL-Listed for household and commercial use. This item's durable toaster design and stainless steel construction meets household, office or hospitality/hotel kitchen requirements. Amazon.com This handsome (and speedy) toaster delivers beautifully browned toast, waffles, or English muffins in 90 seconds flat, serving them up on a removable tray that doubles as a crumb tray, then transitions nicely to breakfast table or bar. The UL-listed Quik-Serve features the durable construction needed for heavy-duty office or hotel use, along with a sleek design that fits right into the most stylish home kitchen. (The single long slot fits two slices of toast at a time, keeping the toaster's profile narrow, long, and streamlined.) Sturdy stainless steel housing stays cool to the touch even with heavy use. Generous one-inch-wide slots accommodate even oversized bagels, electronic controls deliver even toasting at any of the six doneness settings, and a cancel button stops the toasting process. There's even a bagel setting that toasts the tops only. When the Quik-Serve is done toasting, its tray folds up for compact storage or removes for cleaning, while the cord storage keeps things neat on crowded countertops. This 1400-watt, 120-volt toaster measures 15 inches long by 6 inches deep by 10 inches tall and comes backed by a one-year limited warranty. --Mary Park","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y-+27g4JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"West Bend","source_asin":"B000W6LZJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085290","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000W6LZJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000W6LZJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
