window.products.push({"id":1085303,"name":"Insulated Soup Jars Vacuum Sealed 16 Oz Stainless Steel Food Containers No BPA (Stainless Steel)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wpah9HO4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Lunch Rejuvenation 16 oz insulated food container keeps food warm up to 5 hours making it ideal for adults and kids lunches or anytime you are eating food on the go. Enjoy soups, crock pot dishes and more inside a food grade stainless steel hot food jar.  The lid and rubber seal are BPA free and have a button to release pressure making it easier to remove the vacuum sealed lid. The size means it fits inside lunch bag or backpack yet it holds enough food for a regular meal. No more waiting for the microwave to heat up your food at the office! Having a warm lunch ready to go means you are free to go wherever you want during your break. You also have more control over what you and your kids eat during lunch the most frequent meal eaten outside of the home. Eat straight from the container or from the container lid.  Have a waste-free lunch at work or school while also saving money from eating out. Many who eat out during lunch on spend $10 on average. By bringing your lunch you save $936 per year while also going waste free!  According to the EPA each child with a disposable lunch (juice boxes, plastic wraps, etc.) generates an average of 67 pounds of trash per school year! Adults also generate their own amount of garbage during lunch. Having lunch in a hot food container ready to go saves time during your lunch break, money, and are more likely to have a waste-free lunch.  Most realize the best way to eat healthy is to have control over what goes into your food. From the need to avoid allergic reactions to special diets for diabetics to those who feel better eating a strict diet, everyone has a reason for controlling what they eat. It’s much easier to control your food by bringing it with you in a hot food container. Enjoy healthy food choices with a stainless steel insulated hot food lunch container from Lunch Rejuvenation where our goal is to make you feel inspired from what you eat and do during lunch not dog tired.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wpah9HO4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lunch Rejuvenation","source_asin":"B00QOGU6DU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085303","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QOGU6DU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QOGU6DU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
