window.products.push({"id":1085322,"name":"HOME RIGHT Stainless Steel Over The Toilet Storage Shelf Silver,3-Tier Bathroom Organizer Over Toilet,Bathroom Space Saver Rack with 2 Hooks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x8PI9WyzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Stainless Steel Material ] Our over toilet shelf is made from stainless steel materials, is rustproof. It is superior to the particleboard—may swell in a damp environment for a long time, ensure the long-lasting durability. Silver is designed for aesthetic appeal, goes well with your various bathroom styles. [Stable&Safety] 2 adhesive clips with reinforcement stickers can stick tightly to the wall, horizontal supporting bar also makes contribution to its stability, they work together to prevent the bathroom organizer over the toilet from tipping over. 4 adjustable rubber feet at the bottom designed for leveling shelf on uneven floors, non-slip and prevent scratching your floor. The hemming design of the board makes it a smooth edges, protect children from being scratched by sharp edges. [Space Saving& Large Storage Space] The shelf unit is 17.8'' L*11.02''W*60.24''H, located in a very small space but provided an adequate amount of storage. It features 3 large storage board(16.9'' L*7.87 W), you can put your toiletries, toilet paper, laundry basket, plants etc. 2 multi-purpose hooks are great for hanging towels,brushes.33 lbs or more each tier, much higher load-bearing capacity than other wire storage shelves without bending. [Before Purchase] The bottom space is 17.5''L*11.02''W*33.07''H and the support piece that goes under the tank is 3.54'' from the floor, suitable for ordinary small toilet on market for space saving consideration.So please measure the dimension of your toilet and where your valve is before you purchase for a check, thanks. [Easy Assembly] With a step by step instruction guide and tools, you can have it assembled in about 30 minutes.If there are pluming in the back of your toilet,cross bar on the bottom suggested to be installed after you have it over the toilet not before.If there are any issues before or after purchase, please contact us without any hesitation, we will offer the best solution within 12 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x8PI9WyzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOME RIGHT","source_asin":"B09CPJJMD2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CPJJMD2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CPJJMD2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
