window.products.push({"id":1085407,"name":"Herb Guard - Airtight Jar (1 Oz) and Smell Proof Container (500 ml) Comes with Humidity Pack to Keep Goods Fresh for Months","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Izu94T2YL._AC_SL1452_.jpg","description":"KEEPS CONTENTS FRESH FOR MONTHS - The Premium UltraViolet (UV) Glass protection preserves your herbs, spices, coffee & teas and keeps them fresh for months. Ensure your goods never dry out and even bring dried goods back to life in under a day. AIRTIGHT SMELL PROOF SEAL LOCKS IN ODORS - Have full confidence knowing that the smell proof containers and airtight lids lock in all scents and smells. Keep your business private with our smell proof seal ANTISTATIC GLASS PROTECTS YOUR CONTENTS - Herb Guard offers authentic Anti Static glass materials in all of our jars. Do not be fooled by stainless steel and plastic containers claiming to be anti static. Our glass truly prevents your contents from being stripped of their precious properties, ensuring you get a premium experience every time you store with Herb Guard. NOT JUST A JAR, AN ENTIRE STORAGE KIT - Easily travel with your contents inside of our resealable travel bags. Each jar also comes equipped with a humidity pack to ensure your contents stay at the perfect 62% humidity levels and never dry out. PREMIUM GLASS THAT’S BUILT TO LAST - Our 500ml Jar is 6 Inches height by 3 Inches.The first thing you’ll notice the moment you pick up our jars? The weight and quality of our ultraviolet glass. Our jars are not only designed to protect your precious contents, they’re designed to withstand breaks and drops.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Izu94T2YL._AC_SL1452_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Herb Guard","source_asin":"B0B9CGGK49","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9CGGK49","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9CGGK49","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
