window.products.push({"id":1085460,"name":"Bulk Pack of 10 - Miraculous Medal Rosary Centerpiece 1 Inch Silver Oxidized Finish with Blue Enamel Rosary Center Pieces for Rosary Making Supplies, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OWPiiCYfL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"You will receive 10 of these beautiful Miraculous Medal rosary center pieces for 1 low price! These beautifully detailed rosary center pieces from Italy measure 1\" (2.6 cm) in height. These silver oxidized with a blue enamel accent rosary centerpieces are die cast for exceptional detail as only the Italians have truly mastered. A great building block to make your own rosary or to add to any chaplet, DIY rosary, antique rosary, rosary kit, rosary repair, rosary jewelry making supplies, and more! The Miraculous Medal is one of the most popular Catholic medals in the world, making this rosary centerpiece a perfect addition to any rosary. The Miraculous Medal was originally called the medal of the Immaculate Conception. Because of the numerous accounts of miracles by those who wore it, it later became known as the Miraculous Medal. The Miraculous Medal is a visual reminder of our salvation through Jesus Christ. It is unique among all other medals because it is the only medal designed by Our Lady herself. The Blessed Mother promises extraordinary graces to those who wear the medal and intercedes on our behalf to the foot of her Son, our Lord Jesus Christ.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OWPiiCYfL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caritas et Fides","source_asin":"B00ZIWHXZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085460","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZIWHXZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZIWHXZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1085461,"name":"Clock Square by Design Turnpike, 18x18-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FPUMHr74L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a clock created with old license Plates. David Bowman creates handmade license plate art and maps under the name design Turnpike. As a boy, David loved license Plates. His interest in maps, geography, travel and crafting grew to inspire the art he creates today. He continues to brainstorm and produce various new designs along with his classic license plate maps. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FPUMHr74L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B01LWMCI43","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LWMCI43","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LWMCI43","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
