window.products.push({"id":1085511,"name":"C.R. Gibson Ceramic Measuring Spoon Set, By Jessie Steele, Vintage Inspired Design Features One of Each: 1 tablespoon, 1 teaspoon, 1/2 teaspoon, 1/4 t","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zKvobOz2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Look for coordinating kitchen accessories and recipe organization in the Macarons collection by artist Jessie Steele. A super sweet combination of mint green and pink give this set of ceramic measuring cups a vintage vibe. Features one each of: 1 tablespoon, 1 teaspoon, 1/2 teaspoon and 1/4 teaspoon. Hand washing is recommended. Makes a great gift for that special cook in your life. Search for coordinating recipe cards, recipe file boxes, pocket organizers and pocket page recipe books in the Macarons collection or see additional refreshing and colorful patterns by other renowned artists and sought-after designers by searching for products from C.R. Gibson. 140 plus years young, C.R. Gibson was founded in 1870 in New York City by lithographer John Gibson. The focus then was on letterhead, stationery and marriage certificates. After beginning production of baby books in 1898, millions have been sold. 1 in every 4 babies today has a memory book made by C.R. Gibson. In the 1960s, the company expanded into the gift book and photo album market and now continues to progress through the digital technology age as the number one provider of products that celebrate life's most cherished moments. C.R. Gibson has since made artistic alliances and partnerships with some of the most unique and trusted brands to bring consumers a wide choice of not only high-quality paper products, but party and entertaining supplies with panache, along with kitchen, wedding and everyday gift items, all of which combine the most current trends, the best artists in the market and superior quality. Inspiring, fun and thoughtful products that you would be proud to give and excited to receive. That's just the first 140 years and so much more is still to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zKvobOz2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C.R. Gibson","source_asin":"B00JZOH3NO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JZOH3NO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JZOH3NO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
