window.products.push({"id":1085598,"name":"Without brand 3 in1 Apple Peeler Corer Slicer Chrome Plated Silver Color with Stainless Steel Blades and Vacuum Suction 30x11x14cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aADour4WS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3 in 1 Apple Peeler Corer Slicer combines three functions , detach slicer-corer blade by loosening the butterfly nut with a tool.2.For slicing and coring without peeling, pivot peeler-arm to the side and lock it in place with the peeler-arm lock. Problem Solution 1.Can't peel A. 3 prong gripper fork must be centered through corer/slicer blade and make sure peeler arm lock is released B. Adjust blade by increasing gap within 4mm at a time, if the gap is too big it will gouge apple. 2.Fruit is not slicing Slicer/Corer blade maybe on backwards. 3.Missing parts or broken Please return it to and contact the seller via to resend.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aADour4WS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Without brand","source_asin":"B0986S8GTF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0986S8GTF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0986S8GTF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1085599,"name":"KIDS RULE 2-Piece Unicorn and Stars Glow in The Dark Comforter Set, with 1 Twin Bed Size Comforter and 1 Standard Pillowcase, Rainbow Colors, Pink, Mu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":80.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817rZQ0cMqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Kids Rule Stars and Unicorn Glow in the Dark Comforter Set is the perfect addition to your little dreamer's bedroom. This magical bedding set will create a fantastical atmosphere that will make bedtime more exciting and fun for your child. The set is designed with a vibrant, colorful unicorn on a rainbow-colored sky, which glows in the dark for a unique and magical effect. The comforter set is made of high-quality, soft material that is perfect for a great night's sleep. The comforter has a cozy and warm texture, which is perfect for snuggling up and keeping your little one warm without the weight. The comforter is also designed with a lightweight filling that provides the right amount of warmth and comfort, making it perfect for year-round use. The Kids Rule Stars and Unicorn Glow in the Dark Comforter Set is also easy to care for. The comforter and pillowcases are machine washable, which makes cleaning and maintaining the bedding set a breeze. You won't have to worry about the colors fading or the design peeling off, as the set is made with high-quality, fade-resistant material that will last for a long time. The bedding set comes in a variety of sizes, making it perfect for children of all ages. The Kids Rule Stars and Unicorn Glow in the Dark Comforter Set is perfect for any child who loves unicorns, rainbows, and all things magical. The glow-in-the-dark feature adds an extra touch of magic to the set, making it a unique and one-of-a-kind bedding set. Overall, the Kids Rule Stars and Unicorn Glow in the Dark Comforter Set is an excellent investment for any parent who wants to create a magical and fun environment for their child's bedroom. The high-quality materials, easy care, and unique design make this bedding set a must-have for any child who loves unicorns and all things magical. So, give your little dreamer the gift of magic with the Kids Rule Stars and Unicorn Glow in the Dark Comforter Set!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817rZQ0cMqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kids Rule","source_asin":"B0BGM9WGHH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGM9WGHH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGM9WGHH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
