window.products.push({"id":1085607,"name":"Maxam Kitchen Utensil Stainless Steel Vegetable Spiral Slicer, 10-5/8\" x 4-1/2\" x 2-7/8\", Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zrQcXMRFL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Maxam Vegetable Spiral Slicer is a fun way to add flair to any of your dishes. Decorate your plate with spiral cut cucumbers or zucchini. But today you can go much further than simply decorating your plate, you can begin to eat healthier too. This slicer can help you make delicious noodle dishes and special salads. Try replacing noodles with spiral cut sweet potatoes for a delicious sweet potato fettuccini with gorgonzola and cranberries. Or maybe spiral slice that zucchini for a sun-dried tomato pesto with zucchini pasta with corn, beans, and spinach. Take your veggies to the next level, and create salads to die for, like, cucumber noodles in peanut sauce or a spiralized beetroot salad. There are no limits to what you can create. Even simple spaghetti can be made by spiral cutting your favorite squash into noodles and covering them with your favorite sauce. Creating garnishes, soups, salads and main dishes can be an absolute joy with the spiral slicer and the sky is the limit. Eat healthier and make those dishes look like art. And if you don't want to eat completely healthy, maybe spiral slice some potatoes for yummy curly fries. The Maxam Spiral Slicer features razor sharp stainless steel blades with chrome plated winding rod, screw on handle, and a 3 prong extension. Made from durable stainless steel the body also includes a vacuum base for secure stability. The spiral slicer measures 10 5/8 inch x 4 1/2 inch x 2 7/8 inch. Stainless steel construction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zrQcXMRFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maxam","source_asin":"B00AZZFGXG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AZZFGXG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AZZFGXG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
