window.products.push({"id":1085660,"name":"KAMJUNTAR 15PCS Gold Bathroom Accessories Set, Rustic Farmhouse Bathroom Accessory Set-2 Soap Dispenser, 2 Glass Storage Jars, Soap Rack, Storage Bask","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711i5SUf0KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Extra 2 Replacement Spare Pump Head】- 15 PCS Value Bathroom Accessory Set！Our gold bathroom accessories set includes 2 soap dispensers（11oz）, 2 storage jars, 2 replacement spare pump head , 1 soap rack, 1 storage basket, 1 medium tray, 5 labels, 1 foaming net. 15 pcs bathroom accessories are a smart way to organize your bathroom. 【Soap Holder & Storage Basket】- The golden storage basket in the glass bathroom accessories set has a large capacity and can hold 6 bottles of bathroom accessories, such as hand sanitizer, skin care products, shampoo, shower gel, etc. The golden soap holder in the gold bathroom accessory set has a beautiful shape and a hollow design at the bottom, which can keep the soap dry and prolong the life of the soap. 【Soap Dispensers and Storage Apothecary Jars】- The soap dispenser with pump head in the glass bathroom accessories set can easily and smoothly press out the liquid, which is very suitable for hand sanitizer, lotion, essential oil, etc. The storage jars in bling bathroom accessories set have two sizes, one large and one small, suitable for storing cotton swabs, cotton pads, etc. Both are made of high-quality thick glass for a beautiful and luxurious look, perfect for your bathroom accessories. 【Multi-function】- KAMJUNTAR bathroom decor sets accessories are ideal for home bathrooms, hotels, apartments, restrooms, vanities, and more. The bathroom decor sets accessories are also great as wedding gifts, housewarming gifts, baby showers gift, Thanksgiving, Mother's Day and Christmas gifts for loved ones, friends, neighbors and colleagues. Showcasing your style with a stylish and luxurious look, glass bathroom decor sets are the perfect gift. 【Satisfaction Guarantee】- Each accessory in the glass bathroom accessories set comes in an individual box. But glass is fragile, if you receive a damaged glass bathroom accessories, please feel free to contact us and we will give you a refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711i5SUf0KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KAMJUNTAR","source_asin":"B09SG3YSJ3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SG3YSJ3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SG3YSJ3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1085661,"name":"#110-400 Glass Gallon Jar Wide Mouth White Metal Lid Food Grade Seal Replacement Top 4 1/2\" Inch 4.4\" 110mm 4.25\" 4.33\" Continuous Threads By JL Misso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7162SM12SEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Attention: This lid will not fit all gallon glass jars, there are at least three different common sizes used on gallon jars. I carry other lids as well including different gallon jar lids. #110-400 Metal replacement wide mouth glass gallon jar lid. Factory states 110mm size, I measure outside diameter of the lid at 4.4\" at the bottom, 4.25\" inside diameter at the top of the threads. The jar this lid fits measures at 4.33\" outside diameter at the top of the threads. This fits most wide mouth gallon jars, A Continuous thread lid with food grade plastisol liner appropriate for hot fill processes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7162SM12SEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JL Missouri Parts","source_asin":"B07GZZR7XK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GZZR7XK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GZZR7XK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1085662,"name":"Disney 90inx62in Frozen Olaf Micro Raschel Blanket - Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714u72CbYKL._AC_SL1320_.jpg","description":"Keep warm snuggled up in bed or vegging out on the couch with this lusciously warm Frozen blanket! Featuring a large Olaf printed graphic, this fleecy blanket offers incredible warmth and comes in a delightful oversized design perfect for wrapping yourself up in.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714u72CbYKL._AC_SL1320_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Disney Frozen","source_asin":"B077HSR4PD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077HSR4PD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077HSR4PD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1085663,"name":"KoMo Mio Mill, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sou2FUOzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Combine the freshest-ever look in grain mill design with impeccable grinding performance and what do you get? The iconic NEW KoMo Mio! Rarely has a grain mill introduction created excitement like the buzz for the Mio. One PHG newsletter reader responded immediately: \"Are you kidding? Sign me up!\" and their enthusiasm has been echoed by many. All dry grains can be ground with the KoMo Mio mill, including soft or hard wheat, oat groats (dehulled oats), rice, triticale, kamut, spelt, buckwheat, barley, rye, millet, teff, quinoa, amaranth, sorghum, soybeans and dent (field) corn. It will also grind lentils, dry beans (pinto, red, garbanzo/chickpeas, kidney & more), and dried, non-oily spices. It isn't suitable for herbs, oilseeds like flax or sesame, popcorn, or fibrous materials. Dent (field) corn and soybeans can be ground to any texture from cracked to meal to very fine flour. For these very large-kerneled grains, grind first with the stones opened widely to produce cracked grain, then a second time if you want flour. The KoMo Mio will grind oats to a wonderfully soft, fine textured flour, but open the stones about five clicks (or so) wider than you would for a hard grain like wheat, otherwise the soft oat flour will fill the stones' furrows and in-feeding will stop. Opening the stones further will give you a cereal grind for porridge, or coarser yet for cracked oats, similar to steel-cut. At Pleasant Hill Grain, our experience spans the milling spectrum from home-use to commercial. As the exclusive U.S. importer of Austrian-made KoMo mills, Pleasant Hill Grain is proud to represent their fine European craftsmanship to our customers. We'd be delighted to visit with you about a KoMo mill or any aspect of your milling needs. We'd appreciate your business, and we look forward to serving you in any way we can!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Sou2FUOzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KoMo Mills","source_asin":"B07HJ44SND","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HJ44SND","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HJ44SND","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
