window.products.push({"id":1085733,"name":"Hadeight Green Tissue Box Cover Square for Bedroom Decorative Cube Leather Tissue Box Holder for Car 1 Pcs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dHdjXXjwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pu Leather [ TISSUE BOX COVER SIZE: ] - 5.7\"×5.5\"×5.7\" / 14.5×14×14.5cm(L×W×H), the dimension of top opening is 1.96\"/5cm. Please confirm the specific size before you purchase it. [ LEATHER & METAL MATERIAL ] - The surface of this tissue box cover is made of high-quality leather and flannelette cloth inside. Besides, it's added a metal handbag lock as a switch, and metal top opening, which not only can be used as a decoration but also enhances the sense of modern fashion. [ OPENED FROM THE TOP ] - The biggest difference from the traditional tissue box holder is that you can put the tissues into it from above instead of the bottom. Because is the closing of the metal switch is highly steady, so the tissues won't fall off the bottom like the traditional tissue box even though you pick up this tissue box. [ APPLICABLE PLACE ] - This tissue box cover square combines traditional handmade leather technology with the trendy style design, its like a decorative box, has a living room decor aesthetic, which is ideal for housewarming gifts new home, home decor, office decor, bedroom dressers decor, bathroom organizer decor, centerpiece table decorations， nightstands, car, automotive use. [ FREE REPLACEMENT ] - Free replacement if any quality issues, and please feel free to contact us if you have any other questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dHdjXXjwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hadeight","source_asin":"B08Y6GYF6N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y6GYF6N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y6GYF6N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
