window.products.push({"id":1085735,"name":"Automatic Foaming Soap Dispenser,AGECASH A Touchless Soap Dispenser with Infrared Sensor,Rechargeable Hand Free Soap Dispenser,330ml Adjustable Liquid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nPuYEJ-ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【0.25S Automatic Foaming】: Auto-soap dispenser applies infrared sensor design, no need to touch, just put your hand 2-3 inch below the sensor, and dispense foam at a speed of 0.25S to free your hands for deep cleaning. When the hand leaves, the soap dispenser will automatically stop foaming, no dripping or tailing, to avoid cross-infection. 【Rechargeable and Waterproof 】: The hands-free soap dispenser is a waterproof and leak-proof design. built-in Micro USB interface, 1200mAh, long standby, high-quality chargeable battery extend the service life, about 2-3 per charge Hours, it can work for more than 30 days, which is very convenient and can avoid battery replacement pollution. 【Adjustable Volume Design】: Touchless foaming soap dispenser has 3 level of adjustable modes with low foam(one press flashing green) ,middle foam(press again flashing cyan) and high foam(press again flashing blue) modes to better meet your requirements. The eco- friendly ABS material bottle body is bright and visible, so the soap can be easily refilled at any time without tools. 【Suitable for all Kinds of Soap】: It is recommended to add foam soap detergent, but for ordinary liquid detergent, it needs to be diluted 2-6 times with water before use. Simple human soap dispenser automatic large capacity of 11.0 ounces. The foaming hand soap dispenser is very suitable for kitchen sinks, bathrooms, coffee shops, hospitals, offices 【Best Service and Guarantee】: If you are not satisfied with this automatic hand sanitizer dispenser, please feel free to contact us, we will reply and deal with it within 24 hours. The package includes 1 x soap dispenser, 1 x instruction manual, 1 x charging cable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nPuYEJ-ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AGECASH A","source_asin":"B08B143Z5Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B143Z5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B143Z5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
