window.products.push({"id":1085778,"name":"hecef Chef Knife Set of 6, Matte Black Kitchen Knife Set with Acrylic Stand, Hammered Stainless Steel Blade & PP Handle, Suitable for Any Tasks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wl2LFqy0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Black Matte Art Cuisine Knives: Our cooking knife set includes 8\" chef knife, 8\"santoku knife, 8\"bread knife, 5\"utility knife and 3.5\"paring knife. All knives are kept safely in the knife acrylic block for space efficient storage. The acrylic stand is also suitable for the galaxy blue knife set. Matte Black Non-stick Coating: The coating layer provides a stable coated barrier between the steel and environment that can increase corrosion and rust resistance, protecting the blade not being scratched by hard substances. Exquisite Hammered Finish: The elegant hammered steel makes it a special and functional craft, eliminating friction and keeping food from sticking to the blade. Ergonomic Knife Set: Each knife has been precisely constructed to ensure superior grip feeling. This set is equipped with extraordinary stainless steel to make it more durable than other knife sets and ensure that is easy to maintain in a proper way. The handle groove design is for easy grip, and two curves on handle make the knife look more elegant. Stylish 3 Layers Acrylic Stand: Our stand is heavier with 3 layer acrylic and is made to be seen! The acrylic stand not only help showcase the kitchen knives and taking away guesswork, but also double as a kitchen decor and a conversation starter in the home kitchen! Moreover, there are 8 extra non-slip mats for better control, some fastening nails over the stand for durability and aesthetic looking and 3 adjustable screws on the top for stability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wl2LFqy0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hecef","source_asin":"B08R851FF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085778","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R851FF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R851FF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
