window.products.push({"id":1085784,"name":"River City Clocks 14\" one Day Mechanical Hand-Carved Cuckoo Intricate Leaves and Vines Wall Clock, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":385.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GvTrAOLSL._AC_.jpg","description":"This hand-carved German cuckoo clock features intricately carved leaves and vines. It has wooden hands, a wood dial with Roman numerals, and a warm light yellow hand-painted and hand-carved cuckoo bird. Two cast iron pine cone weights are suspended beneath the clock case by two separate brass chains.The hand-carved maple leaf pendulum continously swings back and forth which controls the timing of the clock. If your cuckoo clock's timing should ever need adjustment, you can control the speed of your clock by sliding the maple leaf up or down the pendulum stick. Sliding the maple leaf down causes the cuckoo clock to run slightly slower, while sliding the maple leaf up makes the cuckoo clock run slightly faster.On every hour the cuckoo bird emerges from a swinging door above the clock dial and counts the hour by cuckooing once per hour. (Example: At one o'clock the bird will cuckoo once. At eight o'clock the bird will cuckoo eight times) The half hour is announced with one cuckoo call. The 30 hour all brass mechanical Regula movement, which is produced in the Black Forest of Germany, is wound once per day by raising the two pine cone weights. One weight powers the time and the other weight powers the cuckoo and cuckoo call.Great effort has been made to portray each cuckoo clock as accurately as possible. As with many handmade items, the exact coloration and carving may vary slightly from clock to clock. We consider this to be a special part of their character. This clock is covered by a two year limited warranty covering workmanship and manufacturers defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GvTrAOLSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"River City Clocks","source_asin":"B004T393HU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004T393HU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004T393HU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1085785,"name":"ZooeyRoose Blue Silk Artificial Flowers Combo Box Set, Peonies Roses Dahlia Orchid Fake Flowers for Decoration, Hydrangea Faux Floral for DIY Cake Bri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZMXsi6HJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌺Wedding Decor: Wedding flowers infuse color into so many aspects of your big day. This silk fake flowers are for DIY bridal bouquet,table or diaper cake arrangements ,You’ll have the option to keep your bouquet or a table centerpiece from your wedding as a memento for years to come 🌺Built to Last: Thanks to its silk polyester fiber,The real touch realistic looking artificial flowers are both wrinkle-resistant and water-resistant for long-lasting and durable,they make an excellent economic and aesthetic alternative to the real flowers 🌺Package&Size: The diameter of each flower head: 2.2in cream small peony x1, 2.8in cream small rose x2,3.9in cream peony x2,3.9in cream rose x4,3.5in blue peony x2,3.1in blue orchid head x3, 4.3in blue pink hydrangea x4, 3.1in Dark Blue Hydrangea x1, 2.4in blue rose head x1, 3.9in Light Blue Dahlia head x1, 3.9in light blue rose head x1,green plants 🌺Versatility: Silk flowers are perfect for DIY wedding bouquets, centerpieces table,baby shower,Christmas party,home.and they aren’t just for bouquets and arrangements.They’re perfect for dressing up a cake as well,Celebrate Spring,Capture Small Details,Channel a Boho Vibe,Spruce Up Your Altar. 🌺Tips:May be squeezed or deformed during transport,just used a blow dryer on a low setting can restore their to their shape.These silk flower are handmade please understand that the size may vary slightly and there might be slightly color difference between different dye lots.We also have other different flower combinations for you to choose from","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZMXsi6HJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZooeyRoose","source_asin":"B0BM4FD3TZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM4FD3TZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM4FD3TZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1085786,"name":"Couristan Recife Wicker Rug 5'10\" x 9'2\" Stitch/Black/Cocoa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TxGaq8u+L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"1681/2000 Wicker Stitch Rug. This rug features a solid color inset with a small patterned border and comes in the following two colors: black/cocoa and cocoa/natural. Great for use in transitional, modern, and traditional decors. Don't Be Fooled. Every outdoor rug is 100% polypropylene… on the surface.  Most outdoor rugs use Jute beneath the surface to hold their rugs together.  While this does allow for a faster, easier production, it is subject to dry rot, and discoloration of connecting fibers. Unlike our competition, Couristan employs a 100% polypropylene binding system to ensure a longer lasting, higher quality indoor/outdoor rug. At Home Anywhere. Houses, Apartments, RVs, Townhomes, seriously any home.  Indoor or outdoor, a rug is a simple and inexpensive way to make any space feel like a home. It adds warmth underfoot, while softening the feel of any area. They can be used in high traffic areas, near pools, on patios, decks, kitchens, laundry rooms, basements—the list is endless. Color Beyond. Our colors penetrate the entire fiber and are mixed with a UV stabilizer to ensure that our rugs stay brighter for longer. Harsh Environments Demand Strict Testing. Couristan has been at the forefront of outdoor design and development since introducing the outdoor rug.  We believe that testing is our responsibility to you.   We set the standard by requiring that all our outdoor rugs pass 6 laboratory tests before earning the Couristan outdoor name. Kid and Pet Friendly. These rugs are paraben free, making them both kid and pet safe.  The rug can be hosed and dried outside, making it great for high traffic areas and rooms that see heavy use.  Kids are no match for this rug.   For over 90-years, the Couristan brand has been revered as an icon of style and quality for its exquisite area rugs. The Recife Rug Collection is one of our top selling outdoor collections. Home to a multitude of styles and colors.  If you love the concept of this performance indoor/outdoor rug, but haven’t found your perfect design or color, don’t fret. We’ve got you covered with a multitude of designs to fit almost any home.  Our durability is unparalleled making this a great rug for high traffic areas, homes with pets, or just about anyone looking for great quality and value.  Explore its line up and experience its benefits today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TxGaq8u+L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Couristan","source_asin":"B008TQOZBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008TQOZBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008TQOZBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
