window.products.push({"id":1085837,"name":"Home-X Bath Mat, Loofah-Textured Shower Mat for Bathroom, Exfoliating Shower Mat, Beige-23” X15 ¾”","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9148QamVwnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you are looking for a sanitary solution to slipping in the shower, this textured bath mat is an excellent choice. This basic bath mat is more than meets the eye. In fact, it has a variety of features that make it superior to other in-shower mats. The loofah-texture surface is one of the main distinguishing features of this unique and useful mat. Simply place the mat somewhere along the base of your bathtub and add soap or body wash to create a light lather. From there, you can rub the bottoms, sides, and heels of your feet one by one along its surface. If you suffer from dry, scaly feet, this may just be the solution for you. Get baby-soft feet without having to spend on exfoliating stones or pedicures. This innovative, carpet-like mat adds an extra element of safety for elderly people, children, or other individuals who struggle with slipping in the shower. This mat is perfect for your master, guest, or family bathroom. Purchase multiple so you can have one in every bathroom in your house that has a shower or bathtub. This household accessory is neutral-colored, so it will match any decor. Its nonporous, textured surface helps keep bacteria from getting trapped in your long scrubber mat, further protecting your feet. We recommend hanging the mat up to dry after each use in the shower in order for it to dry properly and last longer. Do not machine wash. Unlike other similar bathroom accessories, this mat is nonabsorbent, allowing water to easily flow through. Because of its filter-like design, this mat is easy to clean if hair or other debris accumulate in it. Depending on placement, it can even help keep things like hair and soap scum from blocking your drain. Place the mat right below the showerhead, where you stand, or at the end of the tub, depending on what you prefer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9148QamVwnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B08425QYY2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085837","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08425QYY2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08425QYY2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
