window.products.push({"id":1085854,"name":"Ritz 100% Polyester Microfiber 12-inch x 12-inch Multi Purpose Kitchen Dish Towel, Gentle Cleaning Wash Cloth with Poly Scour Side, Assorted Pink/Yell","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OUuKFBHoL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"This Ritz 4-piece set of solid microfiber dish cloths with poly scour sides aid in cleaning without harming surfaces. Coordinating colors of blues and greens, each cloth is made with a microfiber side and a poly scour side. Each towel measures 12-Inch by 12-Inch and is designed with a contrasting stitched edge. Microfiber is highly absorbent, streak-free, lint-free and multi-functional. Machine wash cold with like colors and tumble dry low. Features: 4 100 percent Polyester Microfiber Kitchen Dish Cloths 4 100 percent Polyester Microfiber Kitchen Dish Cloths Lint-Free. Streak-Free. Multi-Functional. Lint-Free. Streak-Free. Multi-Functional. Machine Wash on cold; tumble dry low Machine Wash on cold; tumble dry low Measures 12 x 12 inches. Measures 12 x 12 inches. 2 Different Color schemes available to fit any kitchen style. 2 Different Color schemes available to fit any kitchen style. Why Ritz? Established in 1892, the John Ritzenthaler company (Ritz) has long been synonymous with the finest quality in home textiles. Today, the John Ritzenthaler company is a privately owned manufacturer, wholesaler and distributor of a complete line of high quality, color coordinated, fashion basic and designer bath and kitchen textiles, as well as, specialty laundry and cleaning aids. As a leader in the home textiles category we are experienced in working on Ritz initiated design concepts, licensed designs and also with interpreting customer requests into new products. Our marketing and design teams work closely together to identify product opportunities within the marketplace to help create the right product mix for our customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OUuKFBHoL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ritz","source_asin":"B004ZYF4RG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085854","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004ZYF4RG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004ZYF4RG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1085855,"name":"Personalized Grandma Blanket - Custom Grandma with Grandkids Name, Mothers Day Christmas Blanket Gift for Grandma, Nana, Mimi (A 4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719gTLlThIL._AC_SL1125_.jpg","description":"MaterialsFleece, SherpaDETAILS --These blankets are perfect for Mother's Day presents, Birthday Gifts, Halloween, Christmas and other special occasion.I always like to recommend at least a 50x60. A 30x40 is a better fit for a child but can be used as a small lap blanket.Design: Printed On One Side. Designs are printed using high quality inks that will not fade or peel. The fabric stays silky smooth against skin. This is NOT embroidery or vinylCare: Machine Wash; Tumble DryAvailable Materials: Fleece (Thickness: 0.35 cm), Sherpa (Thickness: 1 cm)Please Note: All sizes have a variance +/- 1\"-2\" due to heat causing shrinking when pressed.FAQS:What size do you recommend?I always like to recommend at least a 50x60. A 30x40 is a better fit for a child but can be used as a lap blanket.What material is most popular?Minky and Sherpa are our most popular because of the softness and thickness.Are these personalized?Yes, the personalization name(s) will be changed to the any that left in the notes for me during checkout. If you would not like a name to be added you can leave the note blank or simply leave \"No Name.\".What is Fleece?Fleece blankets are made of 100% Polyester. It is a thinner blanket but provide a very vibrant print.What is Sherpa?Sherpa is an Ultra Plush blanket. It is a 100% polyester with a faux fur fabric on the back.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719gTLlThIL._AC_SL1125_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09TD7N6FY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1085855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TD7N6FY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TD7N6FY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
